# sriq: DisjointUnion. A is the disjoint union of B and C; D is an A that is not a
# B, so D is a C.
# Expect: D ⊑ C.

@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:A a owl:Class . :B a owl:Class . :C a owl:Class . :D a owl:Class .
:A owl:disjointUnionOf ( :B :C ) .
:D rdfs:subClassOf :A .
:D owl:disjointWith :B .
